{"title":"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_16\">Problem 16</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 16\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>At Doggy Daycare, there is one dog for every bowl of food, two dogs for every bowl of water, and three dogs for every bowl of treats. Every dog gets a serving of food, water and treats. If there are a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/f/7af4b3f8897671e2879b10badf471e5deec8952e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$77$\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" /> bowls, how many dogs are there?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/7/6772b35aa2a5017dcc069a6463421a3925703abb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 35 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 77\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 42\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 11\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"397\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Soltuion_1\">Soltuion 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Soltuion 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let's say that there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> bowls of food, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> bowls of water, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> bowls of treats and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> dogs.\n</p><p>Then there would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> bowls of food, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/f/4efb0d2bbadee907f1faf666965b000fb3940be7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lceil\\frac{D}{2}\\right\\rceil$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"42\" height=\"45\" /> bowls of water and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/8/a080e019e1291244911ba9c6801fd76972d167ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lceil\\frac{D}{3}\\right\\rceil$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"42\" height=\"45\" /> bowls of treats.\n</p><p>(<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a05dffbb4608c5e7d969822860fb2ca4c30e3e7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lceil\\frac{A}{B}\\right\\rceil$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"41\" height=\"45\" /> means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/4/2c4b24976c1967d7ab34d4dd4d7454fa19e46ee0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{A}{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"21\" height=\"39\" /> but rounded up if it isn't a whole number, this is often referred to as the \"ceiling\" of a number)\n</p><p>If we know there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/f/7af4b3f8897671e2879b10badf471e5deec8952e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$77$\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" /> bowls in total, then we also know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> + <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/f/4efb0d2bbadee907f1faf666965b000fb3940be7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lceil\\frac{D}{2}\\right\\rceil$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"42\" height=\"45\" /> + <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/8/a080e019e1291244911ba9c6801fd76972d167ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lceil\\frac{D}{3}\\right\\rceil$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"42\" height=\"45\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/f/7af4b3f8897671e2879b10badf471e5deec8952e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$77$\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p>For approximation just use <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> + <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/f/b5f1048864067d4ba7703dfc40f3022b8d87840b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{D}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"21\" height=\"39\" /> + <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/2/c42f5eb4c7ebf76db43522d6e70077be5c443ac2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{D}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"21\" height=\"39\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/f/7af4b3f8897671e2879b10badf471e5deec8952e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$77$\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/d/28d42fb442f545aedee8d2a217bc9c4eb0241495.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{11D}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"40\" height=\"39\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/f/7af4b3f8897671e2879b10badf471e5deec8952e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$77$\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" /> which simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/b/d8bebca4e3640e7842374690966b4a29f1d69297.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"36\" height=\"14\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/d/ead3b7508463cec715e65e4ca4c73f4675bd185a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$462$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/0/ed0d6c36fdad9c2874053be46c7e4120f2edcf47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$42$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />. \n</p><p>Now plug that into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> + <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/f/4efb0d2bbadee907f1faf666965b000fb3940be7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lceil\\frac{D}{2}\\right\\rceil$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"42\" height=\"45\" /> + <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/8/a080e019e1291244911ba9c6801fd76972d167ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lceil\\frac{D}{3}\\right\\rceil$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"42\" height=\"45\" />, plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/0/ed0d6c36fdad9c2874053be46c7e4120f2edcf47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$42$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/0/ed0d6c36fdad9c2874053be46c7e4120f2edcf47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$42$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> + <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/5/f25d31faf472ddb4c698a14522fe8125c06f8dd8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> + <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/0/820a20de2847dfdc1bc5cffc8d904933150032bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/f/7af4b3f8897671e2879b10badf471e5deec8952e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$77$\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" /> so it works out. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/0/840784921d3398e13a49a91857699f23457edead.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(C)}\\ 42}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"65\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~any1sgame and typo fix by anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\